# React UI (Hugo)

See [frontend/components/AGENTS.md](../../frontend/components/AGENTS.md).

- No Supabase calls in components — data via props from RSC pages.
- Import domain types from `@/lib/<domain>`; never re-export from components.
- shadcn/ui primitives under `ui/`; composition over boolean prop soup.
- No domain logic in UI — severity, health, approval rules stay in `lib/`.
- Async clicks: `onClick={() => { void handler(); }}`.
- After client mutations: `router.refresh()` or TanStack `invalidateQueries` as appropriate.
- Interactive flows (approve, investigate, dialogs): labels, focus, keyboard paths.
